sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: A straight line commensurable with the side of the sum of two medial areas is the side of the sum of two medial areas.
----
proof:

Let {AB} be the side of the sum of two medial areas, and {CD} commensurable with {AB}.

It is to be proved that {CD} is also the side of the sum of two medial areas.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="240" height="95" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="X.70 diagram" src="propX70.gif"/></noscript>
